# Mapbox public token (pk.…): 3D map. Without it the site uses the free MapLibre map.
PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
# RapidAPI key with the free "NAVITIME Route(totalnavi)" Basic plan (500 requests/month, hard limit).
# RAPIDAPI_KEY: build-time timetable for the longer rides (npm run timetable). Stays secret.
RAPIDAPI_KEY=
# PUBLIC_RAPIDAPI_KEY: the "Live times" button fetches the next trains on the phone. Visible in the
# site's code; the free plan's hard limit means the worst case is the month's searches running out.
PUBLIC_RAPIDAPI_KEY=
# Hot Pepper Gourmet (Recruit, free): adds a "Seats 8" chip to search for group-friendly restaurants.
PUBLIC_HOTPEPPER_KEY=
